    <p className="mt-4 pl-11 text-sm text-muted-foreground">For general academic credentials, WES is the fastest and most widely used option. If you hold a medical degree (MD, MBBS), you must use the Medical Council of Canada (MCC). If you are targeting Alberta PNP streams, IQAS is recommended. For pharmacy degrees, the PEBC is required. We evaluate your profile and recommend the correct organization during your consultation.</p>
