    <p className="mt-4 pl-11 text-sm text-muted-foreground">No. If you hold a medical degree (MD, MBBS, BMed), you must use the Medical Council of Canada (MCC) for your ECA. WES does not assess medical degrees. Using the wrong organization will result in a rejected assessment and lost time.</p>
